# status: draft (Phase 6a, 2026-11-03), waiting for the owner's approval
# Elderroot villagers: the Elder, Maren the herbalist and young Tamsin (DIALOGUE_DESIGN.md §10).
# Voices: DIALOGUE_DESIGN.md §7. Names and terms: dialogue/glossary.md.
# Only GameState, QuestManager, Inventory, PlayerData, DragonManager, Cutscene and AudioManager may be called.

~ elder
if GameState.has_flag("met_elder")
	=> elder_repeat
do GameState.set_flag("met_elder")
Elder: [#worried] Aurelia. Up with the sun again, nose in that spellbook?
Aurelia: [#embarrassed] Chapter twelve! Lantern charms. I only set my sleeve on fire twice.
Elder: Hm. Practice is good. But the village needs hands as much as spells today.
- Who needs help?
	Elder: Maren is out of Sunpetal for her remedies. She's in her herb garden, just there.
	Elder: [#worried] And little Tamsin lost something. She's up in the meadow, by the pond.
- But I'm only a Spark...
	Elder: [#proud] Every lantern in Elderroot was lit from one small spark.
	Elder: Go and see Maren in her garden, or Tamsin up by the pond. Helping is practice too.
Aurelia: [#determined] Right. I'll do my best!
=> END

~ elder_repeat
if QuestManager.is_done("herbs_for_maren") and QuestManager.is_done("lost_satchel")
	Elder: [#proud] Maren's remedies, Tamsin's smile... The whole village is talking about you.
	Aurelia: [#embarrassed] It was mostly running around. And a few braziers.
elif PlayerData.rank >= 1
	Elder: [#proud] Your lantern burns brighter than it did. Don't let it go to your head.
else
	Elder: Maren is in her herb garden. Tamsin is up in the meadow, by the pond.
=> END

~ elder_bark
% Elder: Lovely morning. Too lovely, perhaps.
% Elder: Read less, sleep more, Aurelia.
=> END

~ maren
if QuestManager.is_done("herbs_for_maren")
	Maren: [#happy] The Sunpetal tea is working wonders. Brew yourself a tonic, dear.
	=> END
if QuestManager.is_on_step("herbs_for_maren", 1)
	=> maren_hand_over
if QuestManager.is_active("herbs_for_maren")
	Maren: Three Sunpetal, dear. The golden ones, here in my garden or out in the meadow.
	=> END
Maren: [#worried] Oh, Aurelia! Half the village is coughing, and my Sunpetal jar is empty.
Maren: Could you pick me three? Golden flowers. Gently, they bruise.
- Of course! Three Sunpetal, coming up.
	Maren: [#happy] Bless you. Bring them here when you have them.
- Can a Spark even pick flowers properly?
	Maren: [#happy] Ha! Flowers don't care about rank, dear. Neither do I.
do QuestManager.start("herbs_for_maren")
if QuestManager.is_on_step("herbs_for_maren", 1)
	Aurelia: [#happy] Oh! I already have some.
	=> maren_hand_over
=> END

~ maren_hand_over
Maren: [#happy] Is that Sunpetal I smell?
- Here you go. Three of them.
	if Inventory.has("sunpetal", 3)
		do Inventory.remove("sunpetal", 3)
		do QuestManager.advance("herbs_for_maren")
		Maren: [#happy] Perfect! Take my Stamina Tonic recipe, and a potion for the road.
		Maren: Moonbloom grows by the pond. Brew at the kit beside any Lantern Shrine.
	else
		Maren: [#worried] I only count a few here. Three, dear. Three!
- Can I keep them a little longer?
	Maren: Of course. Just don't brew them into potions, or I'll cough at you.
=> END

~ maren_bark
% Maren: Sunpetal for coughs, Moonbloom for tired feet...
% Maren: Mind the flowers, dear!
=> END

~ tamsin
if QuestManager.is_done("lost_satchel")
	Tamsin: [#happy] I wear my satchel on BOTH shoulders now. Like a real explorer!
	=> END
if QuestManager.is_on_step("lost_satchel", 1)
	=> tamsin_return
if QuestManager.is_active("lost_satchel")
	Tamsin: [#sad] It's in the old ruins, east of the pond. Past the gate with the big lanterns.
	=> END
Tamsin: [#sad] Aurelia... I lost my satchel. My pressed-flower book is inside.
Tamsin: I chased a dragonfly into the old ruins and dropped it up on the high ledge.
Tamsin: Then the gate shut behind me, and the steps... they just weren't there anymore!
- Steps that disappear? That sounds like old magic.
	Tamsin: [#happy] You know magic! You can find it, right?
- Don't worry. I'll bring it back.
	Tamsin: [#happy] Really? Thank you!
Aurelia: [#thinking] Old lanterns, a shut gate, vanishing steps... Maybe they just need some light.
do QuestManager.start("lost_satchel")
if QuestManager.is_on_step("lost_satchel", 1)
	=> tamsin_return
=> END

~ tamsin_return
Aurelia: [#happy] Is this the satchel you lost?
do Inventory.remove("tamsin_satchel", 1)
do QuestManager.advance("lost_satchel")
Tamsin: [#happy] My satchel! And my flower book isn't even squashed!
Tamsin: Mum says these are for emergencies. You're always having emergencies.
Aurelia: [#embarrassed] That's... fair.
=> END

~ tamsin_bark
if QuestManager.is_done("lost_satchel")
	% Tamsin: [#happy] Look, a dragonfly! ...I'm not chasing it. Not today.
	% Tamsin: [#happy] Thank you, Aurelia!
else
	% Tamsin: [#sad] My satchel...
	% Tamsin: Have you seen a dragonfly this big?
=> END
